    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>1. MOVE</strong></h2>Your score is the distance you reach. Distance controls everything. Keep moving forward to unlock guns, to regen, to find loot.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016900/extras/18042142c697f213b3ab5846c43f6240.poster.avif?t=1723495848\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016900/extras/18042142c697f213b3ab5846c43f6240.webm?t=1723495848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016900/extras/18042142c697f213b3ab5846c43f6240.mp4?t=1723495848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>2. KILL</strong></h2>The further you go, the harder it gets. Get ready to kill your way through swarms of enemies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016900/extras/30c5e8a39ab28379352a69423235a631.poster.avif?t=1723495848\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016900/extras/30c5e8a39ab28379352a69423235a631.webm?t=1723495848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016900/extras/30c5e8a39ab28379352a69423235a631.mp4?t=1723495848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>3. UPGRADE</strong></h2>Get the biggest guns you can find. Stack as many passive perks as you can. But don't kill yourself with your new toys.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016900/extras/102badc2b7f49853c1e4035182f65577.poster.avif?t=1723495848\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016900/extras/102badc2b7f49853c1e4035182f65577.webm?t=1723495848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016900/extras/102badc2b7f49853c1e4035182f65577.mp4?t=1723495848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>4. GET CREATIVE</strong></h2>Skills won't be enough to survive, you\u2019ll have to get creative to go further. Use the environment. Exploit the physics.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016900/extras/2397a4e1857fbc776259f0e6dc70e4e9.poster.avif?t=1723495848\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016900/extras/2397a4e1857fbc776259f0e6dc70e4e9.webm?t=1723495848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016900/extras/2397a4e1857fbc776259f0e6dc70e4e9.mp4?t=1723495848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ABOUT</strong></h2>I'm Aurelien Rodot, a freelance engineer. Scree is a pet project I\u2019m doing for fun, I hope you\u2019ll have fun too :)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEEDBACK</strong></h2>Feedback really helps me, please post what you like and what you don't in the steam community or on our discord server.",
